# File Size And Decomposition

Keep new and heavily modified files focused and maintainable.

## Rule

- Do not create or grow files beyond roughly 200 lines when avoidable.
- If logic expands, split by responsibility into helper modules/services.
- Prefer composition over large monolithic files.

## Allowed exceptions

- Generated files
- Migration snapshots

